Subject: [PATCH 1/2] chore(trace): ignore local assets and run outputs

Keep licensed checkpoints, local assets and regenerated TRACE outputs out of source control.
---
 .gitignore | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 126be93..0e4a83e 100755
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -15,4 +15,10 @@ __pycache__/
 demo/images/
 log/*
 simple_romp/.DS_Store
-.DS_Store
\ No newline at end of file
+.DS_Store
+
+# Machine-local TRACE assets, licensed checkpoints and regenerated inference
+# outputs.  These are experiment dependencies/results, not source revisions.
+assets/
+checkpoints/
+outputs/
